age-switcher\"><summary aria-label=\"Language\"><span class=\"language-flag\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇿</span><span class=\"language-current\">Čeština</span><span class=\"language-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"language-options\"><a href=\"/grammatica/a2/futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"it\" lang=\"it\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇮🇹</span><span>Italiano</span></a><a href=\"/en/grammar/a2/the-futuro-semplice-tense.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇬🇧</span><span>English</span></a><a href=\"/es/gramatica/a2/el-futuro-semplice-italiano.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇪🇸</span><span>Español</span></a><a href=\"/fr/grammaire/a2/le-futuro-semplice-italien.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇫🇷</span><span>Français</span></a><a href=\"/cs/gramatika/a2/italsky-futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\" aria-current=\"page\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇿</span><span>Čeština</span></a><a href=\"/pl/gramatyka/a2/wloski-futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"pl\" lang=\"pl\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇵🇱</span><span>Polski</span></a><a href=\"/tr/dilbilgisi/a2/italyanca-futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇹🇷</span><span>Türkçe</span></a><a href=\"/de/grammatik/a2/das-italienische-futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇩🇪</span><span>Deutsch</span></a><a href=\"/ja/bunpo/a2/イタリア語の-futuro-semplice.html\" hreflang=\"ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇯🇵</span><span>日本語</span></a></div></details><nav><a href=\"/cs/gramatika/\">Gramatika</a><a href=\"/cs/cteni/\">Čtení</a><a href=\"/cs/slovni-zasoba/\">Slovní zásoba</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/cs/o-nas/\">O nás</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rezervace na Preply</a></nav></div></header>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"page-intro\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\"><p class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/cs/\">Domů</a> / <a href=\"/cs/gramatika/\">Gramatika</a> / A2 / Italský futuro semplice</p><p class=\"eyebrow\">Gramatika A2</p><h1>Italský futuro semplice</h1><p class=\"lead\">Mluvte o programech, prognózách a slibech: zítra se budu učit, vy odejdete, budeme cvičit.</p><div class=\"lesson-meta\"><span>12 minut</span><span>10 cvičení</span><span>Úroveň A2</span></div><div class=\"lesson-nav\"><a href=\"#forma\">Formulář</a><a href=\"#usi\">Použití</a><a href=\"#irregolari\">Nepravidelný</a><a href=\"#esercizi\">Cvičení</a></div><div class=\"pdf-downloads\" aria-label=\"PDF downloads\"><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"/pdf/cs/italsky-futuro-semplice-a2.pdf\" download=\"\">PDF A2</a></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section compact-top\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\">\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"forma\"><h2>Jak se tvoří?</h2><p>U mnoha sloves odstraňujeme koncovku infinitivu a přidáváme budoucí koncovky.</p><table class=\"conj-table\"><thead><tr><th>Persona</th><th>Parlare</th><th>Prendere</th><th>Partire</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>io</td><td>parlerò</td><td>prenderò</td><td>partirò</td></tr><tr><td>tu</td><td>parlerai</td><td>prenderai</td><td>partirai</td></tr><tr><td>lui / lei</td><td>parlerà</td><td>prenderà</td><td>partirà</td></tr><tr><td>noi</td><td>parleremo</td><td>prenderemo</td><td>partiremo</td></tr><tr><td>voi</td><td>parlerete</td><td>prenderete</td><td>partirete</td></tr><tr><td>loro</td><td>parleranno</td><td>prenderanno</td><td>partiranno</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mini-note\"><strong>Poznámka:</strong> ve slovesech v -are se z A stává E: mluvit → budu mluvit, jíst → budu jíst.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"usi\"><h2>Kdy to použijeme?</h2><div class=\"rule-grid\"><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Programy</strong><br>Zítra navštívím centrum.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Předpovědi</strong><br>Myslím, že bude pršet.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Sliby</strong><br>Zavolám ti večer.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Hypotézy o současnosti</strong><br>Bude doma? = možná je doma.</div></div></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"irregolari\"><h2>Časté nepravidelné futures</h2><table class=\"conj-table\"><thead><tr><th>Infinito</th><th>Base futura</th><th>Esempio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>essere</td><td>sar-</td><td>sarò, sarai, sarà</td></tr><tr><td>avere</td><td>avr-</td><td>avrò, avrai, avrà</td></tr><tr><td>andare</td><td>andr-</td><td>andrò, andrai, andrà</td></tr><tr><td>fare</td><td>far-</td><td>farò, farai, farà</td></tr><tr><td>venire</td><td>verr-</td><td>verrò, verrai, verrà</td></tr><tr><td>potere</td><td>potr-</td><td>potrò, potrai, potrà</td></tr></tbody></table></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\"><h2>Časté chyby</h2><div class=\"mistake-grid\"><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: io parleraio.</strong>Corretto: io parlerò.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: domani vado a Roma, sempre.</strong>Corretto: domani andrò a Roma.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: loro partirà.</strong>Corretto: loro partiranno.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: io andarò.</strong>Corretto: io andrò.</div></div></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"esercizi\"><h2>Cvičení s okamžitou zpětnou vazbou</h2><p>Napište jednoduchou budoucnost.</p><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"parlerò\" data-alt=\"parlero\" data-hint=\"Já + mluvit: budu mluvit.\"><label>1. Io ___ con Martin. (parlare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"partirai\" data-hint=\"Ty + odejít: odejdeš.\"><label>2. Tu ___ domani. (partire)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"prenderà\" data-alt=\"prendera\" data-hint=\"Lei + vzít: vezme.\"><label>3. Lei ___ il treno. (prendere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"mangeremo\" data-hint=\"My + jíst: budeme jíst.\"><label>4. Noi ___ alle otto. (mangiare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"vedrete\" data-hint=\"Ty + uvidíš: uvidíš.\"><label>5. Voi ___ il risultato. (vedere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"saranno\" data-hint=\"Být je nepravidelné: budou.\"><label>6. Loro ___ felici. (essere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"andrò\" data-alt=\"andro\" data-hint=\"Jít je nepravidelné: půjdu.\"><label>7. Io ___ in Italia. (andare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"farai\" data-hint=\"Dělání je nepravidelné: budete dělat.\"><label>8. Tu ___ gli esercizi. (fare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"avremo\" data-hint=\"Mít je nepravidelné: budeme mít.\"><label>9. Noi ___ tempo. (avere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"verranno\" data-hint=\"Příchod je nepravidelný: přijdou.\"><label>10. I miei amici ___ stasera. (venire)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"score-card\"><div><strong>Váš výsledek</strong><p id=\"score-text\">0 správných odpovědí z 10</p></div><strong id=\"score-percent\">0%</strong></div><div class=\"exercise-actions\"><button class=\"reset-btn\" id=\"reset-exercises\" type=\"button\">Začněte znovu</button><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"../\">Zpět ke gramatice</a></div></article>\n  </div></section>\n  <section class=\"conversion-section teacher-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"teacher-cta-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Italiano con Martin</p><h2>Vyberte si, s kým se učit italsky</h2></div><p>Dva učitelé, dva přístupy. Vyberte si podle svých zájmů.</p></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-options\"><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/martin-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Martin</strong><span>Věda, technologie a etymologie</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Učit se s Martinem</a></article><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/licia-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Licia\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Licia</strong><span>Umění, trpělivost a gramatika</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.in/LICIA6IT2176799611?ts=17865248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Učit se s Licií</a></article></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-links\"><a href=\"/cs/o-nas/\">Poznejte Martina a Licii</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/59167434075?text=Dobr%C3%BD%20den%2C%20cht%C4%9Bl(a)%20bych%20informace%20o%20lekc%C3%ADch%20ital%C5%A1tiny%20s%20Martinem%20nebo%20Lici%C3%AD.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Napište nám na WhatsApp</a></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"container footer-grid\"><div><strong>Italiano con Martin</strong><p>Jasná gramatika, stupňovaná četba a online lekce.</p></div><div><a href=\"/cs/gramatika/\">Gramatika</a><a href=\"/cs/cteni/\">Čtení</a><a href=\"/cs/slovni-zasoba/\">Slovní zásoba</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/cs/o-nas/\">O nás</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"../../../assets/grammar-exercises.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"../../../script.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n</body></html>";
